  "body": "https://sentry.tools.element.io/organizations/element/issues/39942/?project=2&query=is%3Aunresolved&statsPeriod=24h\r\n\r\nSomeone called `PUT /_matrix/client/r0/rooms/!REDACTED%3Amatrix.org/state/m.room.member/%40REDACTED%3Amatrix.org` with content of the form\r\n\r\n```\r\n{avatar_url: {content_uri: 'REDACTED'}, displayname: 'REDACTED, is_direct: False, membership: 'join'}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe avatar_url is malformed: it [should be a string.](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.4/client-server-api/#mroommember) ",
